{"hymn":"S294","parent":"E371","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":4},"title":"Te necesito hoy","subtitle":"Anhelos—De tener comunión con Cristo","syl":{"n1":["Te‿ne","i"],"n2":["ce","m"],"n3":["si","m"],"n4":["to‿hoy,","t"],"n5":["Ca‿da‿ho","i"],"n6":["ra,","t"],"n7":["bu","i"],"n8":["en","t"],"n10":["Se","i"],"n12":["ñor;","t"],"n13":"Tu","n14":["tier","i"],"n15":["na","t"],"n16":"voz","n17":"a‿mí","n18":"Me","n19":"trae","n20":"la","n22":"paz‿de","n24":"Dios.","n25":["Se","i"],"n26":["ñor,","t"],"n27":"te","n28":["ne","i"],"n29":["ce","m"],"n30":["si","m"],"n31":["to","t"],"n32":"En","n33":["ca","i"],"n34":["da","t"],"n35":["mo","i"],"n36":["men","m"],"n37":["to;","t"],"n38":["Ben","i"],"n39":["dí","m"],"n40":["ce","m"],"n41":["me,","t"],"n42":"hoy","n43":["ven","i"],"n44":["go","t"],"n45":"A","n46":"Ti,","n48":["Se","i"],"n49":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Te necesito hoy,","Mantente junto‿a mí;","No sufro tentación","Si‿estoy cerca de Ti."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Te necesito hoy,","En gozo o gemir;","Ven pronto,‿habita‿en mí","O no podré vivir."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Te necesito hoy,","Muestra Tu voluntad;","Hoy cumple Tú en mí","Tus promesas sin par."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Te necesito hoy,","Oh, Santo, Eternal;","Bendito Hijo, así","Hazme Tuyo‿en verdad."]}]}